<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Formosa Plastics H1 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Formosa Plastics H1 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    17,388 vs 19,238</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			3,922 vs  4,402</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3,603 vs  3,956</p>
<p>NOTE - Formosa Plastics Corp is one of the world's largest polyvinyl chloride (PVC) makers.</p>
</text>
